2391926","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433860/a82ee42d7aa2ce8f09d9affb269c487786208f5e/ss_a82ee42d7aa2ce8f09d9affb269c487786208f5e.600x338.jpg?t=1752391926"}],"short_description":"A dark metroidvania where your shaman drum is the only weapon against the Abyss. The music of the ancients becomes your blade, and every battle is a ritual on the edge of death.","steam_appid":2433860,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://t.me/amortiz_games"},"supported_languages":"English, Russian, German, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}